        "<strong>Stagflation</strong> &mdash; the unusual combination of stagnant growth, high unemployment, and high inflation at the same time.",
        "<strong>Hyperinflation</strong> &mdash; extreme, rapidly accelerating inflation that destroys a currency's value.",
        "<strong>CPI</strong> &mdash; the primary government gauge of inflation/cost of living."
