    "Describe the underwriting process, the roles within a syndicate and selling group, and distinguish firm commitment, best efforts, all-or-none, and mini-max commitments.",
    "Identify the major offering types — IPO, follow-on (APO), and shelf registration — and what each accomplishes for the issuer.",
    "Differentiate exempt securities from exempt transactions and summarize Regulation D, Regulation A, Rule 147, and Regulation S.",
    "Apply Rule 144 holding-period and volume-limitation rules to the resale of restricted and control (affiliate) stock.",
