        "POP = NAV + sales charge; the sales charge % is a percentage of the POP.",
        "POP = NAV ÷ (1 − sales charge %) is the formula for grossing up NAV to POP.",
        "Forward pricing: orders are executed at the NEXT calculated NAV, not the last one.",
        "No-load fund: POP = NAV (no sales charge added)."
