    "Explain core retail strategies—long calls/puts, covered calls, and protective puts—including their motivations and risk profiles.",
    "Describe the role of the Options Clearing Corporation (OCC) in standardizing, issuing, and guaranteeing listed options.",
    "Trace the exercise and assignment process and state the settlement timeframes for options trades and exercises.",
    "Distinguish forwards from futures and explain when and how the Options Disclosure Document (ODD) must be delivered."
