       "type": "text",
       "html": "<p>A <strong>hybrid REIT</strong> combines both approaches — owning some property and holding some mortgages. To qualify for special tax treatment under the Internal Revenue Code, a REIT must satisfy strict structural tests. Memorize the three numbers: <strong>75 / 75 / 90</strong>.</p>"
