       "type": "text",
       "html": "<p>Control of an account can be granted to someone other than the owner through <strong>power of attorney (POA)</strong> or through <strong>discretionary authority</strong> given to the registered representative. The exam tests precisely what each allows and what paperwork is required.</p>"
