       "html": "<p>When a broker-dealer makes a <strong>recommendation</strong> to a retail customer, it must comply with <strong>Regulation Best Interest (Reg BI)</strong> — the standard that the firm and its reps act in the customer's <em>best interest</em> and not place the firm's interests ahead of the customer's. Reg BI replaced the old 'suitability-only' standard for recommendations to retail customers.</p>"
