       "type": "text",
       "html": "<p><strong>Delivery versus payment (DVP)</strong>, also called <em>receive versus payment (RVP)</em>, is a settlement instruction commonly used by <strong>institutional</strong> accounts: the securities are delivered <em>only</em> in exchange for simultaneous payment, eliminating the risk that one side performs and the other does not.</p>"
